        selected=[e for e in events if e['event']=='entry'and e['phase']==phase and e['stage']==stage and e['location']['descriptor']=='(Lnu;)V'];require([e['location']['class']for e in selected]==prefix+chain,'actual most-specific inherited dispatch and parent chain');require([e['location']['method']for e in selected]==([('e'if stage=='factory-read'else'd')]if prefix else[])+[method]*len(chain),'actual reader/writer method chain')
